ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "address"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "where you live"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  What's the address of the restaurant?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coffee shop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy coffee and tea"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant is beside the coffee shop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "far"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a good distance away"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My house is not far from here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "restaurant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to order food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The restaurant is next to the coffee shop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "go straight"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "move forward in a direct way; do not turn"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Go straight on Main Street."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "turn right"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an instruction to move in a different direction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Go straight on Main Street, then turn right on 5th Street. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "turn left"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an instruction to move in a different direction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Go down this street and then turn left. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Draw a map of your neighborhood (include 10 places)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 sentences describing the location of 5 places on the map."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use 1 preposition of place for each of the sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use at least 3 target words."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 5 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the location of places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use words from this lesson."}]}], "type": "sena"}